NOTE ON SCOPE

This license covers the SOFTWARE in this repository only — the Python backend,
the React frontend, the loaders, and the tooling.

It does NOT cover the gear catalogue itself: the root `*.json` seed files and
the data served from them. Those are licensed separately under
Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International — see LICENSE-DATA.

Gear and manufacturer images under `frontend/public/` are covered by neither
license. They remain the property of their respective owners and are used with
